<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Appearance / Layout editor's bottom area (appearance-layout-editor SPEC §3.1–3.6): a
     non-modal M3 sheet docked at the foot of android.R.id.content. AppearanceEditorPanel paints
     its fill (colorSurfaceContainer) and its top corners (shapeAppearanceCornerExtraLarge);
     SurfaceEditorController adds the navigation inset to the bottom padding and sets the height,
     which is AppearanceEditorPanel.measureFor(mode): one fixed height per mode, measured from the
     rows that mode shows. Nothing in it scrolls, and nothing in it is weighted.

     One ConstraintLayout. The top row is both modes'; each mode's rows are a Group
     (appearance_editor_appearance_group / appearance_editor_layout_group), and a mode switch
     shows one Group and hides the other.

     The sheet follows the locale's direction (it is reading-order UI, docked full width, so
     nothing about where it sits changes), though the content root it is added to is pinned left
     to right.

     Top row: the mode pill is the start anchor (wrap_content, never squeezed); Done is pinned to
     the end and Undo to Done's start. Undo is GONE while there is nothing to undo; the gap between
     the pill and Undo absorbs it, so neither the pill nor Done moves.

     Appearance rows. Row A: the Look slider, a label centred under each of its five stops (placed
     in code: the stops sit inside the slider's track padding, so equal-width labels would drift
     off them). Row B: the tapped element's name and up to three equal columns, each a label above
     its control. Row B is GONE until an element is tapped: the sheet's height follows its content
     (Row A alone, or Row A + Row B), the controller animates between the two, and the frame stands
     above the taller of the two so it never moves. The labels may wrap to two lines ("Contrast ·
     Normal" in a third of a phone's width); a Barrier under them keeps the sliders level.

     Appearance Row B also carries, at the Custom stop with nothing tapped, the global row (layout
     editor v2, DECISIONS item 13): Blur, Opacity and Grain in the three columns, the middle one a
     slider of its own (appearance_editor_cl_slider). The keyboard's row is Blur and the
     "Keyboard theme" button in the last column (item 15).

     Layout rows (layout editor v2, DECISIONS items 2, 3 and 10). Row A: Orientation (two 48dp
     icon segments), Style (two 48dp icon segments), and eye-off at the end: the only drop target
     for hiding, the toggle of the hidden tiles, and the count badge's anchor. Behind it a 64dp
     highlight, larger than its 48dp target, shows while a lifted bar may be dropped on it. Row B:
     Corner radius and Margin as two equal columns, each a label above its slider; while the hidden
     tiles are open they stand in Row B's place, one line of chips (it pans sideways when five
     elements are hidden at 360dp), so the sheet never changes height. While the keyboard is
     selected its tools take the same place: the three type chips, then Key radius (a label above
     its slider) in the rest of the row. The tiles win while both would. No hint text anywhere.

     Width arithmetic, dp. Sheet padding 16 + 16, so the content width is W - 32.
       Top row (LabelLarge 14sp, Roboto Medium): "Look" ≈ 30, "Layout" ≈ 43. A segment is
       12 pad + 18 check slot + 4 icon padding + text + 12 pad, minWidth 0: 76 + 89 = 165 for the
       pill. Widget.Termux.Button.Segment pads all four sides 12dp: Material 3's OutlinedButton
       sets paddingLeft/Right 24dp, which beat a paddingStart/End beside them and made every text
       segment 32dp too wide.
       Undo 48 (its own 4dp insets are the visual gaps on either side of it).
       Done (Widget.Material3.Button, minWidth 0 over AppCompat's 88): 24 + "Done" ≈ 33 + 24 = 81.
         360: 16 + 165 + 0 + 48 + 0 + 81 + 16 = 326 ≤ 360  (34 spare, in the pill → Undo gap)
         411: 326 + 85 of gap;  533: 326 + 207 of gap.  Clean (Undo gone): 48 more gap.
       Appearance Row A: the slider spans W - 32 (328 / 379 / 501); five LabelMedium words, the
         widest "Custom" ≈ 44, under stops (W - 32 - 2 × track padding) / 4 apart: ≥ 70 at 360.
       Appearance Row B: three columns, two 16dp gaps: (W - 64) / 3 = 98.7 / 115.7 / 156.3;
         two columns: (W - 48) / 2 = 156 / 181.5 / 242.5; one column: W - 32.
         The Soften toggle in a 156dp column: Off 12 + 18 + 4 + 20 + 12 = 66, On 66: 132 ≤ 156.
       Layout Row A: 96 + 8 + 96 + gap + 48 = 248 + gap; gap 80 / 131 / 253. The 64dp highlight
         is centred on eye-off: 8dp of it stand past the button's end, inside the sheet's 16dp
         padding.
       Layout Row B: two columns, one 16dp gap: 156 / 181.5 / 242.5; "Corner radius · 40 dp"
         (LabelMedium) ≈ 120 ≤ 156.
       Keyboard tools in Row B: three 48dp-tall chips (24dp glyph + 4 + 4 + chip padding ≈ 50
         each, 4dp apart) ≈ 158, 16 gap, Key radius in the rest: 154 / 205 / 327;
         "Key radius · 24 dp" ≈ 105 ≤ 154. Height: label 16 + slider 48 = 64, the chips' 48
         centred on the slider: the row's own 64.

     Heights, dp, without the navigation inset (the controller adds it to the bottom padding):
       top row 48 (every button keeps its 48dp touch height).
       Appearance: 12 + 48 + 8 + Row A (slider 48 + labels 16 = 64) + 8
                   + Row B (name 20 + 4 + label 2 × 16 + control 48 = 104) + 16 = 260.
       Layout:     12 + 48 + 8 + Row A 48 + 8 + Row B (label 16 + slider 48 = 64) + 16 = 204.
     The controller uses the measured heights, not these numbers. -->
<androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_panel"
    android:layoutDirection="locale"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:clickable="true"
    android:focusable="false"
    android:paddingStart="16dp"
    android:paddingTop="12dp"
    android:paddingEnd="16dp"
    android:paddingBottom="16dp">

    <!-- ===================================================================== top row -->

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_mode"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_mode_description"
        app:checkedButton="@+id/appearance_editor_mode_appearance"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent"
        app:selectionRequired="true"
        app:singleSelection="true">

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_mode_appearance"
            app:icon="@drawable/segment_icon_look"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:ellipsize="none"
            android:text="@string/appearance_editor_mode_look" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_mode_layout"
            app:icon="@drawable/segment_icon_layout"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:ellipsize="none"
            android:text="@string/action_layout_editor" />
    </com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup>

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_undo"
        style="?attr/materialIconButtonStyle"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_undo"
        android:tooltipText="@string/appearance_editor_undo"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:icon="@drawable/ic_symbol_undo"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_mode"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_done"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_mode" />

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_done"
        style="@style/Widget.Material3.Button"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:minWidth="0dp"
        android:maxLines="1"
        android:text="@string/appearance_editor_done"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_mode"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_mode" />

    <!-- ============================================================ Appearance mode -->

    <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_look"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_look_description"
        android:stepSize="1"
        android:value="4"
        android:valueFrom="0"
        android:valueTo="4"
        app:labelBehavior="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_mode"
        app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

    <!-- One label per stop, centred under it in code. -->
    <FrameLayout
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_look_labels"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_look" />

    <!-- Row B: its own ConstraintLayout, so the columns' per-element visibility is not the
         Appearance group's to restate. GONE until an element is tapped (see the header). -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_look_labels">

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_name"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorPrimary"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent" />

        <!-- Up to three equal columns: three labels in one chain, and under them a Barrier that
             the three controls hang from, so the sliders line up whichever label wraps. The
             16dp gaps sit on the end of c1 and cl, so whichever of c1 / cl is gone, the visible
             columns keep one gap between them: c1's goneMarginEnd keeps it when cl is gone, and
             c2 has no start margin. A column's views are shown and hidden together in code. -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c1_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:layout_marginEnd="16dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="2"
            android:minLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            app:layout_constraintHorizontal_chainStyle="spread"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_name"
            app:layout_goneMarginEnd="16dp" />

        <!-- The terminal's Contrast: its palette's contrast (SPEC §2, §3.4). -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:layout_marginEnd="16dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="2"
            android:minLines="1"
            android:text="@string/appearance_editor_legibility_normal"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c3_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_c1_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_name"
            app:layout_goneMarginEnd="16dp" />

        <!-- The fourth column, the terminal's only: its Grain, between Text contrast and Blur.
             Every other element has room for Grain in a column it already has (the status bar and
             the dock in the first, the keyboard in the middle). The 16dp gap after it is c3's own;
             cl's goneMarginEnd keeps one when c3 is gone. -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c3_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:layout_marginEnd="16dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="2"
            android:minLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c2_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_name" />

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c2_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="2"
            android:minLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_c3_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_name" />

        <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Barrier
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            app:barrierDirection="bottom"
            app:constraint_referenced_ids="appearance_editor_c1_label,appearance_editor_cl_label,appearance_editor_c3_label,appearance_editor_c2_label" />

        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c1_slider"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="100"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_c1_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c1_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c1_soft"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_soft"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c1_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            app:selectionRequired="true"
            app:singleSelection="true">

            <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_soft_off"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:minWidth="0dp"
                android:text="@string/appearance_editor_soft_off" />

            <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_soft_on"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:minWidth="0dp"
                android:text="@string/appearance_editor_soft_on" />
        </com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup>

        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_legibility"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_legibility_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="2"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

        <!-- The global row's middle control: Opacity (DECISIONS item 13). -->
        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_cl_slider"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="100"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_cl_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c3_slider"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="100"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_c3_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c3_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

        <!-- The keyboard's door to its theme page (DECISIONS item 15), in the last column. -->
        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c2_button"
            style="@style/Widget.Material3.Button.TonalButton.Icon"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:maxLines="2"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:paddingStart="12dp"
            android:paddingEnd="12dp"
            android:text="@string/appearance_editor_keyboard_theme"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_settings_chevron_right"
            app:iconGravity="end"
            app:iconPadding="4dp"
            app:iconSize="18dp"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_c2_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c2_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier" />

        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_c2_slider"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="100"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_c2_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_c2_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

        <!-- The terminal's Trail and Effect: a label over an outlined button that names the
             chosen option and opens a menu of the choices (six trail styles do not fit as a
             segmented row, and "Trail · Motion blur" does not fit a 360dp column). Equal columns
             with one 16dp gap; Effect is GONE below API 33, and Trail then takes the full width.
             Both are GONE for every element but the terminal; each label follows its button. -->
        <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Barrier
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier_controls"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            app:barrierDirection="bottom"
            app:constraint_referenced_ids="appearance_editor_c1_slider,appearance_editor_c1_soft,appearance_editor_legibility,appearance_editor_cl_slider,appearance_editor_c3_slider,appearance_editor_c2_button,appearance_editor_c2_slider" />

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_trail_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:layout_marginEnd="16dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:text="@string/appearance_editor_trail_label"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_effect_label"
            app:layout_constraintHorizontal_chainStyle="spread"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier_controls"
            app:layout_goneMarginEnd="0dp" />

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_effect_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginTop="4dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:text="@string/appearance_editor_effect_label"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_trail_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_row2_barrier_controls" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_trail"
            style="?attr/materialButtonOutlinedStyle"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_arrow_drop_down_16"
            app:iconGravity="end"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_trail_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_trail_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_trail_label" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_effect"
            style="?attr/materialButtonOutlinedStyle"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:visibility="gone"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_arrow_drop_down_16"
            app:iconGravity="end"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_effect_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_effect_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_effect_label" />
    </androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>

    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Group
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_appearance_group"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        app:constraint_referenced_ids="appearance_editor_look,appearance_editor_look_labels" />

    <!-- ================================================================ Layout mode -->

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_orientation"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:contentDescription="@string/termux_layout_editor_orientation"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_mode"
        app:selectionRequired="true"
        app:singleSelection="true">

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_orientation_portrait"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_orientation_portrait"
            android:tooltipText="@string/settings_layout_orientation_portrait"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_portrait"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_orientation_landscape"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_orientation_landscape"
            android:tooltipText="@string/settings_layout_orientation_landscape"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_landscape"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />
    </com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup>

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_style"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_style_description"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation"
        app:selectionRequired="true"
        app:singleSelection="true">

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_style_docked"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_style_docked"
            android:tooltipText="@string/appearance_editor_style_docked"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_docked"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_style_floating"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_style_floating"
            android:tooltipText="@string/appearance_editor_style_floating"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_floating"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />
    </com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup>

    <!-- Eye-off's drop highlight: 64dp, larger than the 48dp target it stands behind, shown
         (INVISIBLE otherwise, so it never moves anything) only while a lifted element may be
         put away. Its rect is the drop area LayoutEditorController gives the canvas. -->
    <View
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden_highlight"
        android:layout_width="64dp"
        android:layout_height="64dp"
        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
        android:visibility="invisible"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden" />

    <!-- Eye-off (DECISIONS items 2 and 3): the only drop target a lifted bar is put away in, and
         a tap opens or closes the hidden tiles. Its count badge is attached in code, after it is
         laid out, and is absent while nothing is hidden. -->
    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden"
        style="?attr/materialIconButtonStyle"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/layout_editor_hidden_none"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_hide"
        app:iconSize="24dp"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation" />

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:ellipsize="end"
        android:maxLines="1"
        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        app:layout_constraintHorizontal_chainStyle="spread"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation" />

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginStart="16dp"
        android:ellipsize="end"
        android:maxLines="1"
        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label" />

    <!-- Under the two labels: the sliders hang from it, so they line up whichever label wraps. -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Barrier
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_layout_barrier"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        app:barrierDirection="bottom"
        app:constraint_referenced_ids="appearance_editor_corners_label,appearance_editor_margin_label" />

    <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_corners"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_corners_description"
        android:stepSize="1"
        android:valueFrom="0"
        android:valueTo="40"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:labelBehavior="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_layout_barrier"
        app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

    <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_margin"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_margin_description"
        android:stepSize="1"
        android:valueFrom="0"
        android:valueTo="48"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:labelBehavior="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_layout_barrier"
        app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

    <!-- The hidden tiles (DECISIONS item 3): one chip per hidden element, each with the restore
         arrow; a tap brings it back to its last edge, a drag onto the canvas to the edge it is
         dropped on. While open they stand where Corner radius and Margin are, which are hidden
         meanwhile, so the sheet keeps its height. -->
    <HorizontalScrollView
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden_tiles"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:fillViewport="false"
        android:scrollbars="none"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label">

        <com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden_tile_group"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/layout_editor_hidden_tiles_description"
            app:chipSpacingHorizontal="8dp"
            app:singleLine="true" />
    </HorizontalScrollView>

    <!-- The keyboard's tools (DECISIONS item 6): while the keyboard is selected they stand where
         Corner radius and Margin are, which are hidden meanwhile (the hidden tiles' swap), so the
         sheet keeps its height. The three type chips at the start, centred on Key radius's
         slider; Key radius takes the rest of the row, a label above its slider. The row is pinned to
         Corner radius's extent (the 48dp chips stand a little past the slider, unclipped), so the
         sheet is the same height either way. -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_tools"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:clipChildren="false"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label">

        <com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_forms"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            app:chipSpacingHorizontal="4dp"
            app:chipSpacingVertical="4dp"
            app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius"
            app:selectionRequired="true"
            app:singleLine="true"
            app:singleSelection="true">

            <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_form_docked"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.LayoutEditor.KeyboardFormChip"
                android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_keyboard_form_docked"
                app:chipIcon="@drawable/ic_symbol_keyboard_docked"
                app:chipIconSize="24dp" />

            <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_form_floating"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.LayoutEditor.KeyboardFormChip"
                android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_keyboard_form_floating"
                app:chipIcon="@drawable/ic_symbol_keyboard_floating"
                app:chipIconSize="24dp" />

            <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_form_split"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.LayoutEditor.KeyboardFormChip"
                android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_keyboard_form_split"
                app:chipIcon="@drawable/ic_symbol_keyboard_split"
                app:chipIconSize="24dp" />
        </com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup>

        <!-- Key radius: the key caps' radius, moved here from Look mode (DECISIONS item 6). -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginStart="16dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_keyboard_forms"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent" />

        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_key_radius"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/layout_editor_key_radius_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="24"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />
    </androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>

    <!-- Row A's members only: Row B (Corner radius and Margin, or the hidden tiles in their place)
         is shown in code, since a Group restates its members' visibility on every layout pass. -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Group
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_layout_group"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:constraint_referenced_ids="layout_editor_orientation,appearance_editor_style,layout_editor_hidden" />
</androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>
